# trefolio Design System

Light/dark fintech dashboard with emerald accent. Dark navy header, adaptive content area, themed cards. Toggle via `useTheme()` from `@/lib/theme-context`.

> Full design system (personas, voice, tokens, components, accessibility): `.cursor/skills/product-manager/design-system.md`

## Color Palette (light / dark)

- **Background**: `bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-900`
- **Cards**: `.card` class handles both (white / slate-800)
- **Header/Nav**: `bg-nav-bg` (dark navy #0f172a) — stays dark in both modes
- **Accent (primary)**: emerald-500 (#10b981) — buttons, active states, links, positive values
- **Positive/Gain**: `text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400`, `bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-500/10`
- **Negative/Loss**: `text-red-500 dark:text-red-400`, `bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-500/10`
- **Primary text**: `text-gray-900 dark:text-white`
- **Secondary text**: `text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400`
- **Muted text**: `text-gray-400 dark:text-slate-500`
- **Borders**: `border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-700` (cards), `border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-600` (inputs, stronger separators)

## Components

- **Cards**: Use `.card` class (auto dark via globals.css)
- **Buttons**: `.btn-primary`, `.btn-secondary`, `.btn-danger` (auto dark via globals.css)
- **Inputs/selects**: Auto dark via globals.css base styles
- **Pill selectors**: `bg-emerald-500 text-white` (active) / `bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-700 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300` (inactive)
- **Badges**: `rounded` with light bg + matching text — add `dark:bg-{color}-500/10 dark:text-{color}-400 dark:border-{color}-500/20`
- **Modals**: `bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700` over `bg-black/40 dark:bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm`
- **Tables**: Card bg, `bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50` header, `border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-700` separators

## Chart Colors

- Axis ticks: use `isDark ? "#94a3b8" : "#9ca3af"` from `useTheme()`
- Axis lines: use `isDark ? "#334155" : "#e5e7eb"`
- Tooltips: `bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-600`
- Line colors unchanged (emerald, blue, violet, amber, red work in both themes)

## Dark Mode Rules

- Always pair light classes with `dark:` variants for text, backgrounds, and borders
- Header stays dark navy in both modes — no `dark:` changes needed
- Use `useTheme()` hook for dynamic values (charts, inline styles)
- Auth pages (login, signup, etc.) must wrap with `<ThemeProvider>` since they don't go through the main page
- Use `dark:bg-{color}-500/10` for soft colored backgrounds instead of `dark:bg-{color}-900`

## General Rules

- Use `rounded-2xl` for cards and modals, `rounded-full` for pills/badges, `rounded-lg` for buttons/inputs
- Prefer shadows over heavy borders for card separation
- Gain/loss colors: emerald-600 (dark:emerald-400) / red-500 (dark:red-400) for text
